   </property>
   <property name="text">
    <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;After all ingredients are mixed, the Cachaca is distilled in stainless steel columns or copper stills. The copper is preferred by some because it helps to reduce the sulfur compounds in the alcohol which gets rid of any rotten egg odor. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;The columns or stills are then heated for distillation. After that, the Cachaca can be aged in barrels to refine the taste. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
